      "review_summary": "The PR wraps non-Error ClickClack websocket message-handler rejections with formatted Error diagnostics and adds a gateway regression test.\n\nPR surface: Source +9, Tests +37. Total +46 across 2 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Current main has a raw `.catch(reject)` in the ClickClack websocket message path, and a structured rejection from `processEvent` can reach the gateway promise without formatted Error diagnostics.",
